{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09029","headline":"闲居赠友 · 韦应物","name":"闲居赠友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"补吏多下迁，罢归聊自度。\n园庐既芜没，烟景空澹泊。\n闲居养疴瘵，守素甘葵藿。\n颜鬓日衰耗，冠带亦寥落。\n青苔已生路，绿筠始分箨。\n夕气下遥阴，微风动疎薄。\n草玄良见诮，杜门无请托。\n非君好事者，谁来顾寂寞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}